    "Two-finger scroll orbits and pinch zooms. The way Helix has always worked.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Two-finger scroll orbits and pinch zooms. The way Helix has always worked."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le défilement à deux doigts fait tourner, le pincement zoome. Comme Helix a toujours fonctionné."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scrolling zooms, with a wheel or the surface of a Magic Mouse. Drag to orbit.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scrolling zooms, with a wheel or the surface of a Magic Mouse. Drag to orbit."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le défilement zoome, avec une molette ou la surface d’une Magic Mouse. Glissez pour tourner."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The middle button orbits, as in Blender. The left button orbits too, so no middle button is needed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The middle button orbits, as in Blender. The left button orbits too, so no middle button is needed."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le bouton du milieu fait tourner, comme dans Blender. Le bouton gauche fait tourner aussi : aucun bouton du milieu n’est nécessaire."
          }
        }
      }
    },
